Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.68,0:00:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就是有栖他们待过的阿吉特啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那群家伙从那之后就再没露过面{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是逃出这个世界了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马巡查说话方式给我注意点。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是警部，而你是我的部下。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真……真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为交换，只要你好好干就能升级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能拿到这种东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 巴利安警察手册。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔！ 好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来，阿斯特拉尔怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃… 啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个啊，自从和基拉古决斗之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他就再没出来过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身体还没恢复原样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。你应该也明白{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}关于我的事对Astral也要保密。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那件事啊我啊 总觉得隐瞒事情这事……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:00:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这也是 全都是为了Astral
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.42,0:00:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马巡查。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 明白了 真月警部。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《Astral：异晶人使用的强力怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超百 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 那东西会进化成 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以我们现在的力量也无法保证下次还能赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办才好……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了 到底？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 No.吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是想向我传达什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(No.96)呵呵，阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就是 No.96。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来被巴利安那帮家伙整得挺惨啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么，你的力量明明应该已经被封印了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，不过我可不是服从于你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样要是你束手无策的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要不要借我的力量用用？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可没打算借你的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:02:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，算了。告诉你一件好事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还没有取回
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.65,0:02:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们真正的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再去侧耳倾听一次吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去倾听 No.们的声音。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔，你若为光，我便是暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有光存在，暗就必然存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔，阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，我们进入下一个问题吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.90,0:02:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral。喂，Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马，你在干什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙老是不出来，所以我就……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对、对了！老师，我可以去一下保健室吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我至今收集到的 No.卡是50张。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这其中，有我还未获得的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾乃试炼汝之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}试炼……我。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去获得 No.卡的记忆吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时，一切都会开始运转。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡的记忆？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这位是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾乃试炼汝之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与吾进行决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马。你在干什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为啊 星光体他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从钥匙里完全不出来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定是生病了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～ 星光体。没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在就去给你拿药。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了 小鸟同学 冷静一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他……游马不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这里是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 这里是皇之钥匙里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么是我？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是他把你叫到这里的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那家伙是什么人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在吸收Numbers的记忆时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙也是巴利安！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但和他之间的决斗看来是避不开了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾乃试炼汝之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然完全搞不清楚状况但我奉陪到底！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦究竟会让汝变强还是被击垮。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤巴比伦·饲养者！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌中的巴比伦·饲养者送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将另一只巴比伦·饲养者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死者苏生 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤墓地中的巴比伦·饲养者。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气召唤出3只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只等级4的巴比伦·饲养者进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.03,0:07:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虚构王 无形虚体！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 零！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.49,0:07:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有蹊跷。小心点。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动场地魔法 叠放世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在每个回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对没有怪兽超量的玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成500点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的怪兽超量被除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是怪兽效果束缚的卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 不妙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就是效果伤害啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能输啊。我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 全力上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！我 召唤 怒怒怒战士！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降500点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用解放就能召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)再发动 魔法卡 拟声连携！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将等级4以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.53,0:08:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法师族怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 我我我守卫者送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 魔法卡 死者苏生！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从墓地复活这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧，刚巴拉萨！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:09:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚巴拉萨1只可以当作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用变成2只份的刚巴拉萨叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只份的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.61 火山恐龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，游马召唤另一只 No.吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞，我发动我我我魔术师的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级从4变成6。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级6的怒怒怒战士和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.6！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先史遗产 大西洲巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了，这大量展开！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 一口气解决掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动大西洲巨人的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.69,0:10:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.89,0:10:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的生命值减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 大西洲巨人！ 原始生命态!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给那家伙造成大量伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来只要用我们的 No.怪兽攻击就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动未成形虚空的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的怪兽超量怪兽的攻击力总和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加算到这只怪兽的攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力5100！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们怪兽的攻击力竟然……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么家伙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这场决斗已经是我们赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动沃尔卡萨乌鲁斯的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予其攻击力数值的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}岩浆极限！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法破坏那家伙的怪兽!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法 超量·世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方的怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被魔法 陷阱 怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然有这种效果……我 就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用未形幻影攻击阿特兰塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿特兰塔尔是 No.卡。不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未成形拟声怪攻击的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏无效效果将会被无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话 亚特兰塔尔就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 这家伙 强得离谱！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要打倒这只怪兽的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事情变得相当有意思了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…… 星光……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96 为什么 这家伙会!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光 那个敌人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是否有资格
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有 No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是来测试这个的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.19,0:12:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}测试星光？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:12:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 会有那种家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.39,0:13:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光 你已经察觉到了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙没有我的力量是打不倒的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 这是真的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我拥有 你所没有的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恶意 憎恶 愤怒 邪恶之心啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！ 为什么需要那种东西啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁知道呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral 如果你解放我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可以把力量借给你哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里可不是人类的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是输了 游马他会变成什么样呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别问了 Astral！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不需要什么邪恶之心！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后将 沃尔卡萨乌鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变更为守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动未形幻影的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.12,0:14:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加到这个怪兽身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.53,0:14:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是那个效果吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.85,0:14:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 7600！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.47,0:14:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，盖一张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用无形态傀儡攻击沃尔卡萨乌尔斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失的我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又会再次受到场地魔法的效果……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《接下来是我们剩下的最后回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果无法召唤出超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会因场地魔法的效果耗尽生命。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是只要召唤出怪兽之门{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去我们会输的！》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((要是输了的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马会变成什么样啊))
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了 No.96 我解放你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!? 喂 星光体 你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96 把你的力量借给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 要借用那种家伙的力量…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照约定我会让你们获胜。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 召唤我的分身 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.23,0:16:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你… 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.69,0:16:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在要赢下决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将场上的怪兽反转召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 魔法甜点师！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法甜点师的反转效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的魔法师族怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有暗属性怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌将这家伙特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 黑乌鸦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动我我我魔术师的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.39,0:17:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级从4变为2！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.82,0:17:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不是能做到嘛游马君啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.45,0:17:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.62,0:17:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级2的魔法甜点师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用黑乌鸦 我我我魔术师{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.85,0:17:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.79,0:17:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}压轴好戏登场啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 把全部都砸个稀巴烂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾 攻击未形混沌体！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 黑雾的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手1只怪兽的攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相应的 这只怪兽的攻击力提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影增益！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.02,0:18:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在 游马！ 陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 战斗重启！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.73,0:18:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在战斗开始时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会让那场战斗重新开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一瞬间黑色迷雾的效果再次发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加在这只怪兽身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影增益！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.73,0:18:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就能把那家伙狠狠揍趴下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗？星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你需要我的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要邪恶的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，上！黑色迷雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击未成形类人态！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑镜鞭击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这是……梦里出现过的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起来吧，星光体。想起你的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这是什么鬼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里恐怕是那扇门所展示的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通往我记忆的道路。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这前方，有我真正的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的记忆？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗，原来是这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.75,0:19:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想起来了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是记载了世间一切的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡之中记载着世界是如何形成的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.51,0:20:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以及它将走向何方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那过去与未来全部都被记载着。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等、等一下啊。到底要干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡拥有决定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有世界命运的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你可能无法相信{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.73,0:20:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界是由仅仅一张卡诞生的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.12,0:20:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}创造了所有世界的神之卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还没到手的 No.们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.87,0:20:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上面记载着它们的位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的使命就是抢在巴利安之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到这张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又、又来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:20:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们没事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.11,0:21:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.11,0:21:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)怎、怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照约定我这就放你出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记住了，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的未来必定需要邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.83,0:21:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正等着你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那到底是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么说，是在皇之钥里决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那个是 No.96。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从皇之钥里的飞船上逃出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.49,0:21:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我看到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在星辉的记忆中，看到了 No.代码。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.代码？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐，那到底是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《No.96说过的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.53,0:22:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要恶的未来……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.35,0:22:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西，真的会降临在我身上吗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.94,0:23:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
